Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: vendor-prefixes: add Aichi Steel and HIMS
Upstream-Status: Pending

Register the manufacturers of the AMI603 sensor and H432B board. Board
bindings describe the original hardware independently of the BSP publisher.

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
@@ -71,6 +71,8 @@
     description: Aeroflex Gaisler AB
   "^aesop,.*":
     description: AESOP Embedded Forum
+  "^aichi,.*":
+    description: Aichi Steel Corporation
   "^airoha,.*":
     description: Airoha
   "^al,.*":
@@ -617,6 +619,8 @@
     description: HiDeep Inc.
   "^himax,.*":
     description: Himax Technologies, Inc.
+  "^hims,.*":
+    description: HIMS International Corporation
   "^hirschmann,.*":
     description: Hirschmann Automation and Control GmbH
   "^hisi,.*":
